# Observe

<Aside title="Reserved — coming when Drift verification ships" data-variant="not">

Observe recipes will be added as the Drift verification and audit runtime
contracts ship. Drift is a `Verifier` implementation (`implementation.kind:
drift`), not a separate card kind. The Verifier and `AuditCard` specs are
authored; the runtime implementation is not yet available.

</Aside>

Observe capability covers:

- Reading drift signals for a registered model or prompt
- Querying the audit trail for a card or run
- Streaming observability events from Skald agents

These how-to pages will be added alongside the Drift verification runtime. See what runs
today in the [Overview](/overview/).
